      "collectionName": "Fourth Hokage Minato Inspired Oversized T-Shirt - Premium Flame Print Anime Streetwear",
      "description": "Product Overview\nUnleash the spirit of the Hidden Leaf's fastest shinobi. This premium drop-shoulder oversized tee brings the iconic aesthetic of the Fourth Hokage’s legendary cloak straight into modern streetwear. Featuring a bold dual-tone color block and crisp graphic elements, it’s a must-have statement piece for every anime enthusiast.\nProduct Features\n• Authentic Design: Replicates the iconic burgundy fire border from the signature Hokage cloak wrapping around a clean cream-colored body.\n• Premium Graphics: Features a high-density print of the fire kanji (火) on the front chest and the vertical Fourth Hokage character inscription (四代目火影) boldly running down the back.\n• Streetwear Fit: Trendy oversized silhouette with dropped shoulders and loose half-sleeves for ultimate casual comfort.\n• Durable Comfort: Crafted from heavy-density, breathable cotton blend fabric designed to hold its boxy shape wash after wash.\nStyle & Pairing Tips\nRock this oversized graphic tee with black cargo pants, utility joggers, or distressed denim. Finish the look with high-top sneakers for an effortless, streetwear-ready vibe.\nMaterial & Care\n• Fabric: Premium Heavyweight Cotton Blend\n• Fit: Oversized / Loose Fit\n• Neckline: Classic Crew Neck\n• Care Instructions: Machine wash cold inside-out with like colors. Tumble dry low. Do not iron directly over printed graphics.",
